 74-W- 186 ORNL Resonance Evaluation Including Covariance         7443 1451   11
 (ORNL AUG 2014)                                                  7443 1451   12
                                                                  7443 1451   13
 L. Leal, M. Pigni, K. Guber, D. Wiarda, and G. Arbanas           7443 1451   14
                                                                  7443 1451   15
 W-186 resolved resonance parameter evaluation was done in the    7443 1451   16
energy range form 1e-5 eV to 10 keV with the SAMMY code[ref1].    7443 1451   17
Capture and transmission measurements for enriched W-186 and      7443 1451   18
natural tungsten were used in the evaluation. The measurements    7443 1451   19
were done at the Oak Ridge Linear Accelerator (ORELA)[ref2] and   7443 1451   20
at the Geel Linear Accelerator (GELINA), Belgium[ref3]. Neutron   7443 1451   21
transmission and capture data were measured in the energy range   7443 1451   22
from 20 eV to 10 keV.                                             7443 1451   23
 Thermal cross section[ref4] data available in the EXFOR library  7443 1451   24
were also used in the evaluation.                                 7443 1451   25
                                                                  7443 1451   26
 Resonance parameter covariance matrices were also obtained in    7443 1451   27
the SAMMY evaluation process in the energy region 1e-5 eV-10 keV. 7443 1451   28
The RML formalist (LRF=7) was used for the resonance parameters   7443 1451   29
and the compact formalism (LCOMP=2) for the covariance matrix.    7443 1451   30
  Thermal cross section and uncertainty calculated with SAMMY and 7443 1451   31
the PUFF codes are compared with the values listed in the ATLAS   7443 1451   32
of Neutron Resoances in the table below. Also shown is the        7443 1451   33
capture resonance integral, Coherent scattering length and the    7443 1451   34
effective radius R'.                                              7443 1451   35
                                                                  7443 1451   36
    Cross Section        ORNL (b)           Atlas (b)             7443 1451   37
    -------------        --------           ---------             7443 1451   38
       Total         37.97 +/- 0.59             -                 7443 1451   39
       Capt          37.88 +/- 0.59        38.1  +/-  0.5         7443 1451   40
       Scat           0.09 +/- 0.02         0.07 +/-  0.01        7443 1451   41
                                                                  7443 1451   42
 Capture Res. Int.  476.01 +/- 7.43       480.0  +/- 15.0         7443 1451   43
                                                                  7443 1451   44
        R'            7.75 fm               7.64 +/-  0.05 fm     7443 1451   45
                                                                  7443 1451   46
        b_coher      -0.76 fm              -0.73 +/-  0.06 fm     7443 1451   47
